  "texts": {
    "preamble": "The Food Inspector. vs Lankapally Venkateswarlu on 3 July, 2023 The Honourable Sri Justice K.Surender Criminal Appeal No.522 Of 2023 Judgment:",
    "facts": "1. The present prosecution is for the offence under Section 16 (1) 9 (a) (i) of Prevention of Food Adulteration Act, 1954 (for short 'the Act'). 2. The accused were acquitted for the reason of not having an opportunity of getting the sample tested. Notice under Section 13 (2) of the Act was not given. 3. It is the case of the Food Inspector that sample oil was taken from the premises of the accused. The said soya bean oil was sent for analysis and it was found that it failed quality test.",
